# Shared

Cards that more than one domain depends on. Nothing here may link *down* into a
domain namespace: a shared card that knows about billing is no longer shared.

- [[tokens]] — resolves to `shared/tokens.hmd`, this folder's own card
- [[retry-policy]]

Both are bare names found on the spine's first entry, this very directory. A
card in `specs/billing/` reaches the same two pages with
`from /shared import *`, which appends this directory to its search path.
